  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi, I had an idea for a sound optimization sphere for mapping. It would be a simple override of the maximum sound distance value in meters of all 3d sounds coming from all avatars within a programmed area in the map. This sphere would allow a kind of sound dampening between areas or rooms within the map without needing to make the map any larger.",
